INSERT INTO `site_settings` VALUES
(1,'logos/01KYH4G93F5T2VDZT8A0YJ6G0W.png','Gonzales Dental Clinic','The Art of Elite Dental Care','dark','Where Excellence','Meets Every Smile','We believe exceptional dentistry is more than treatment, it’s an experience. Through world class expertise, cutting-edge technology, and a patient-first philosophy, we create timeless smiles with precision, elegance, and uncompromising excellence.\n\n| Famiran Ghandali Gonzales D.M.D |','hero-gallery/01KYBSY34KTBH10M1A4DSM1YXX.png','hero-gallery/01KYBS5AY1A42RSE4S22SZ6QYZ.png','hero-gallery/01KYBS5AY6ZNN3DGRJCPKV4VDK.png','hero-gallery/01KYBS5AYBPS50S0MAXW5B8AQZ.png','21+','54k+','98%','24/7','8:00 AM – 7:00 PM','8:00 AM – 7:00 PM','8:00 AM – 5:00 PM','From the first consultation to the final appointment, everything was seamless and professional. The clinic combines advanced technology with genuine compassion, making every visit stress free. My smile has never looked better, and I’m truly grateful for the exceptional care I received.','Diane R. Bragais','Patient Since 2020','home/01KYCD17MF9G9ESBWQ435T74YA.jpeg','The Art of Elite Dental Care','We believe dentistry is more than restoring teeth it’s about creating confidence, preserving health, and transforming lives through exceptional care. Every smile tells a unique story, and our purpose is to help each patient write theirs with confidence and pride.\n\nBecause true luxury is more than beautiful surroundings it’s the confidence of knowing you’re in expert hands. At Gonzales Dental Clinic, excellence isn’t simply our standard; it’s the foundation of every smile we create.\n\n| Since 2005 |\n\n| Famiran Ghandali Gonzales D.M.D |','about/01KYCCB97G7TWV99ER4VQQX025.jpeg','2005 Founded','Our clinic was founded with a heart for people and a vision to make quality dental care accessible, comfortable, and built on trust.\nOne chair, one dream, and a promise to always put our patients first.','2011 Expanding Our Services','As our community grew, so did the needs we were called to meet. We expanded our range of treatments to the needs of our patients and grew our services to provide more complete and personalized dental care for every smile. ','2016 New Technology','We embraced advanced dental technology to enhance precision, comfort, and patient experience.','2018 Growing Smiles','As our family of patients grew, so did our commitment to creating healthy, confident smiles that last a lifetime.','Choosing this clinic was one of the best decisions I’ve made. The level of expertise, personalized care, and attention to detail is outstanding. I left with not only a healthier smile but also renewed confidence. I highly recommend them to anyone seeking premium dental care.','May M. Nisortado','Patient Since 2022','28 - 1 Don Juan Estevez Street Guevarra Subdivision','Legazpi City Albay, Bicol','0918 633 1795','gonzales.dentalclinic@yahoo.com','https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100041438186614',NULL,'contact/01KYNZE05DMZXSM22E310AJX8H.jpeg','2026-06-04 07:10:22','2026-08-05 22:22:22');
